sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server

    Note over C,S: ── Public Parameters Setup ──
    C->>S: GET /get-parameters
    S-->>C: P (2048-bit safe prime), G (generator of subgroup of order Q)
    Note over C,S: Q = (P - 1) / 2

    Note over C,S: ── Key Derivation (client-side only, never transmitted) ──
    Note over C: x = SHA-256(username ‖ ":" ‖ password) mod Q
    Note over C: y = G^x mod P     ← public key (Schnorr public key)

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over C,S: REGISTRATION
    C->>S: POST /register  { client_id, secret_y = y }
    Note over S: Validate y is a subgroup member: y^Q ≡ 1 (mod P)
    Note over S: Store (client_id, y) in database
    S-->>C: 201 Created  { status: "Registered" }  — or 200 OK  { status: "Updated" } on re-registration
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over C,S: AUTHENTICATION — Schnorr Sigma Protocol (3-move)
    Note over C: Step 1 — Commitment
    Note over C: Pick r ←$ [1, Q-1]   (fresh CSPRNG per session)
    Note over C: t = G^r mod P
    C->>S: POST /login/commit  { client_id, commitment_t = t }
    Note over S: Look up user, validate t is subgroup member
    Note over S: Generate session_id (CSPRNG)
    Note over S: binding = SHA-256(remote_addr ‖ user_agent ‖ session_id)
    Note over S: c = SHA-256(session_id ‖ client_id ‖ t ‖ binding) mod (Q-1) + 1
    Note over S: Store (client_id, t, c, binding) in session — binding NOT sent to client
    S-->>C: 200 OK  { challenge_c = c, session_id }

    Note over C: Step 2 — Response
    Note over C: s = (r + c · x) mod Q
    C->>S: POST /login/verify  X-Auth-Session: session_id  { solution_s = s }

    Note over S: Step 3 — Verification
    Note over S: Recompute binding from current remote_addr, user_agent, session_id
    Note over S: Reject with 401 if binding does not match (relay / MitM detected)
    Note over S: Recompute c from stored inputs — reject with 400 if mismatch (tamper detected)
    Note over S: left  = G^s mod P
    Note over S: right = t · y^c mod P
    Note over S: Accept iff left == right

    alt Proof valid  (Zero-Knowledge: server learns nothing about x)
        Note over S: Issue JWT token signed with server secret
        S-->>C: 200 OK  { token (JWT) }
    else Session expired (> SESSION_TTL seconds since commit)
        S-->>C: 300  { reason: session expired }
    else Binding mismatch (relay or changed network path)
        S-->>C: 401  { reason: session binding mismatch }
    else Challenge integrity check failed
        S-->>C: 400  { reason: challenge integrity check failed }
    else Proof invalid
        S-->>C: 401  { reason: verification failed }
    end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
    Note over C,S: AUTHENTICATED DATA ACCESS
    C->>S: GET /data   Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Note over S: Decode JWT → extract client_id → query PersoData
    S-->>C: 200 OK  { data: message }

    C->>S: POST /data  Authorization: Bearer <token>  { data: "..." }
    S-->>C: 201 Created  { message: personal data updated }
    end

